{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去旅行想尋找刺激感？秘魯的這間懸崖酒店絕對能滿足你！酒店位於秘魯神聖谷（Sacred Valley）的懸崖峭壁上，一個個全透明的膠囊房間懸掛在半空中，讓你體驗睡在海拔百米的壯麗景色中。\n</p>\n<p>要入住這間酒店，客人需要穿上安全裝備，攀爬幾百米的懸崖峭壁才能到達。雖然過程充滿挑戰，但到達後的美景絕對值得。透明的膠囊房間讓你360度無死角俯瞰整個神聖谷的壯麗景色，晚上更可以躺在床上看星星，與大自然零距離接觸。</p>\n<p>你敢挑戰這間懸崖酒店嗎？</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362802338124656_21068735306ae89778cfcd1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362802338124656_21068735306ae89778cfcd1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@_miss_maddie_  @starlodgeperu)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfPCyEaPjOu/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/goex/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GOEX</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%87%b8%e5%b4%96%e9%85%92%e5%ba%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">懸崖酒店</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%a7%98%e9%ad%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">秘魯</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@_miss_maddie_  @starlodgeperu資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfPCyEaPjOu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:21:57.674238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":403,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completene